  "design": {
    "identity": "Hunched pale cold-grey stone guardian with a pointed bird-skull mask and tiny green eyes, huge arched back stone loop, mossy cracks, ribbed chest, circular oath carvings; RIGHT arm/viewer-left is a curved stone scythe; left hand grips a long carved stone slab. Two angular stone feet.",
    "attack": "Coil torso strongly backward, lift scythe above skull then sweep low in one full heavy arc toward LEFT, left slab braces, recoil and settle.",
    "cast": "Wake: bow mask almost to chest, deeply hinge knees, arch back loop high, raise both slab and scythe overhead; oath grooves flare green then a huge stone-energy shockwave; recover.",
    "death": "Cracks spread through joints, shoulders shear, knees buckle and heavy stone plates fall apart into a stable rubble pile; no vanishing, final frame rubble."
  },
